---
import type { Lang } from '../data/i18n';
import type { CatKey } from '../data/categories';
interface Props { lang?: Lang; cat: CatKey }
const { lang = 'ro', cat } = Astro.props;
const en = lang === 'en';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
const ext = { target: '_blank', rel: 'noopener' };
const funding = en ? `${base}en/funding/` : `${base}finantare/`;
---
<p class="muted">{en
  ? <>Examples, not recommendations. Check availability in your country and the fees before opening an account. We receive no commission for accounts opened; if a broker listed here becomes a sponsor, it is clearly marked, under our <a href={funding}>public rules</a>.</>
  : <>Exemple, nu recomandări. Verifică disponibilitatea în țara ta și comisioanele înainte să-ți deschizi un cont. Nu primim comision pentru conturile deschise; dacă un broker de aici devine sponsor, îl marcăm vizibil, după <a href={funding}>regulile publice</a>.</>}</p>
<div class="buy">
  {cat === 'investitii' && (en ? (
    <>
      <div><h3>Crypto</h3><p>Centralised exchanges for tokens already launched. All require identity verification.</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.binance.com" {...ext}>Binance</a> · most of the tokens on the radar</li><li><a href="https://www.coinbase.com" {...ext}>Coinbase</a></li><li><a href="https://www.kraken.com" {...ext}>Kraken</a></li><li><a href="https://www.okx.com" {...ext}>OKX</a></li><li><a href="https://www.bybit.com" {...ext}>Bybit</a></li></ul></div>
      <div><h3>Listed shares</h3><p>S&P 500 companies, recent listings and UiPath, through brokers with access to US and Hong Kong exchanges.</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.interactivebrokers.com" {...ext}>Interactive Brokers</a></li><li><a href="https://www.xtb.com" {...ext}>XTB</a></li><li><a href="https://www.trading212.com" {...ext}>Trading 212</a></li><li><a href="https://www.home.saxo" {...ext}>Saxo</a></li><li><a href="https://www.etoro.com" {...ext}>eToro</a> · also offers CFDs, high risk</li></ul></div>
      <div><h3>Private companies (pre-IPO)</h3><p>Secondary markets, usually for accredited investors only and with high minimums.</p><ul><li><a href="https://forgeglobal.com" {...ext}>Forge Global</a></li><li><a href="https://equityzen.com" {...ext}>EquityZen</a></li></ul></div>
    </>
  ) : (
    <>
      <div><h3>Crypto</h3><p>Burse centralizate pentru tokenurile deja lansate. Toate cer verificarea identității.</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.binance.com" {...ext}>Binance</a> · cele mai multe tokenuri de pe radar</li><li><a href="https://www.coinbase.com" {...ext}>Coinbase</a></li><li><a href="https://www.kraken.com" {...ext}>Kraken</a></li><li><a href="https://www.okx.com" {...ext}>OKX</a></li><li><a href="https://www.bybit.com" {...ext}>Bybit</a></li></ul></div>
      <div><h3>Acțiuni listate</h3><p>Companiile din S&P 500, cele listate recent și UiPath, prin brokeri cu acces la bursele din SUA și Hong Kong.</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.interactivebrokers.com" {...ext}>Interactive Brokers</a></li><li><a href="https://www.xtb.com/ro" {...ext}>XTB</a></li><li><a href="https://www.trading212.com" {...ext}>Trading 212</a></li><li><a href="https://www.home.saxo" {...ext}>Saxo</a></li><li><a href="https://www.etoro.com" {...ext}>eToro</a> · include și CFD-uri, cu risc ridicat</li></ul></div>
      <div><h3>Companii private (pre-IPO)</h3><p>Piețe secundare, de obicei doar pentru investitori acreditați și cu sume minime mari.</p><ul><li><a href="https://forgeglobal.com" {...ext}>Forge Global</a></li><li><a href="https://equityzen.com" {...ext}>EquityZen</a></li></ul></div>
    </>
  ))}
  {cat === 'macro' && (en ? (
    <>
      <div><h3>Commodities</h3><p>In the EU the simplest route is ETCs listed in Europe. Futures need a special account and use leverage.</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.wisdomtree.eu" {...ext}>WisdomTree Europe</a> · ETC</li><li><a href="https://www.cmegroup.com" {...ext}>CME Group</a> · futures</li><li><a href="https://www.ice.com" {...ext}>ICE</a> · futures</li><li><a href="https://www.lme.com" {...ext}>London Metal Exchange</a></li></ul></div>
      <div><h3>Forex</h3><p>Currencies are bought through multi-currency accounts at a bank or broker. Leveraged trading (CFDs) can lose more than you deposit: most retail accounts lose money.</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.interactivebrokers.com" {...ext}>Interactive Brokers</a> · FX conversion at market rate</li><li><a href="https://www.home.saxo" {...ext}>Saxo</a></li><li>Your bank’s multi-currency account</li></ul></div>
      <div><h3>Emerging economies</h3><p>Through exchange-listed country ETFs (for example EEM, INDA, EWZ), bought via a broker. For Romania, the ETF on the BET index, listed on the Bucharest Stock Exchange.</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.bvb.ro" {...ext}>Bucharest Stock Exchange</a> · BET ETF (TVBETETF)</li><li><a href="https://tradeville.ro" {...ext}>Tradeville</a></li><li><a href="https://www.btcapitalpartners.ro" {...ext}>BT Capital Partners</a></li><li><a href="https://www.brk.ro" {...ext}>BRK Financial Group</a></li></ul></div>
    </>
  ) : (
    <>
      <div><h3>Mărfuri</h3><p>În UE, cea mai simplă cale sunt ETC-urile listate în Europa. Futures-urile cer cont special și folosesc levier.</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.wisdomtree.eu" {...ext}>WisdomTree Europe</a> · ETC</li><li><a href="https://www.cmegroup.com" {...ext}>CME Group</a> · futures</li><li><a href="https://www.ice.com" {...ext}>ICE</a> · futures</li><li><a href="https://www.lme.com" {...ext}>London Metal Exchange</a></li></ul></div>
      <div><h3>Forex</h3><p>Monedele se cumpără prin conturi multi-valută la bancă sau la broker. Tranzacționarea cu levier (CFD) poate pierde mai mult decât ai depus: majoritatea conturilor de retail pierd bani.</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.interactivebrokers.com" {...ext}>Interactive Brokers</a> · conversie valutară la cursul pieței</li><li><a href="https://www.home.saxo" {...ext}>Saxo</a></li><li>Contul multi-valută al băncii tale</li></ul></div>
      <div><h3>Economii emergente</h3><p>Prin ETF-uri de țară listate la bursă (de exemplu EEM, INDA, EWZ), cumpărate printr-un broker. Pentru România, ETF-ul pe indicele BET, listat la BVB.</p><ul><li><a href="https://www.bvb.ro" {...ext}>Bursa de Valori București</a> · ETF-ul BET (TVBETETF)</li><li><a href="https://tradeville.ro" {...ext}>Tradeville</a></li><li><a href="https://www.btcapitalpartners.ro" {...ext}>BT Capital Partners</a></li><li><a href="https://www.brk.ro" {...ext}>BRK Financial Group</a></li></ul></div>
    </>
  ))}
</div>
<p class="notice">{en
  ? (cat === 'investitii' ? 'Beware of fake sites. A project’s popularity attracts fraudulent copies. Only go through the official address and never share your wallet’s secret phrase.' : 'Leverage multiplies losses as well as gains. Most retail CFD accounts lose money; check the risk warning shown by each broker.')
  : (cat === 'investitii' ? 'Atenție la site-urile false. Popularitatea unui proiect atrage copii frauduloase. Intră doar de pe adresa oficială și nu-ți da niciodată fraza secretă a portofelului.' : 'Levierul înmulțește și pierderile, nu doar câștigurile. Majoritatea conturilor de retail cu CFD-uri pierd bani; citește avertismentul de risc afișat de fiecare broker.')}</p>
